From: local patch <local@ax3600>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:34:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommax: ax3600: disable TSO on edma
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AX3600 上偶发 qca-edma tx error 0x90000017 / 0x10000017（约 0.2~0.5 条/小时），
状态字解出：错误域内只有 bit28 置位、低 7 位恒为 23（TX queue 0），
sysfs tx_errors 与之 1:1（每事件真丢 1 帧），tx_dropped / tx_fifo_errors /
tx_carrier_errors 全为 0，排除队列拥塞与物理层。

edma 驱动的 DT binding 里预留了 qcom,disable-tso，用于
"PPE egress path may forward a GSO aggregate as one frame instead of
segmenting it for the uplink" 的板型，与上述故障形态一致；仓库内先例为
ipq8072-cr1000a.dts。

本板实测下行约 1:10,000,000 丢帧率，与本改动无冲突：关闭后大帧由软件分段，
CPU 参与度上升的代价在千兆线速以下可忽略。
---
 target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-ax3600-stock.dts | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-ax3600-stock.dts b/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-ax3600-stock.dts
index 9eff101..b25f632 100644
--- a/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-ax3600-stock.dts
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-ax3600-stock.dts
@@ -10,3 +10,8 @@
 		bootargs-append = " root=/dev/ubiblock0_1";
 	};
 };
+
+&edma {
+	status = "okay";
+	qcom,disable-tso;
+};
-- 
2.34.1

